{
  "CE_005020_0000_CER": "If you don't stop now...\r\nI'll never forgive you!",
  "SM_005020_0210_FAS": "“Be safe, you two; \r\nmay Avalon's blessing be upon you.”",
  "CE_005110_0000_CER": "Two down; two to go!",
  "SM_005020_0020_CER": "“Ignis!”",
  "CE_005820_0000_CER": "Calm down, it's okay!",
  "BK_5010_0000_NAR": "Cheshire had returned to his senses,\r\nbut his violent tantrum had\r\ntaken a heavy toll.",
  "BK_5000_0260_NAR": "Cheshire, blind with rage, turned his gaze on Cereza.\r\nThe demon bared its fangs...and pounced!",
  "IN_5000_0010_CER": "“You got it Cheshire,\r\nlet's show him what we can do!”",
  "LV_005010_0020_NAR": "Cheshire's steady voice filled Cereza with courage.",
  "SM_005020_0060_FAS": "“I must say though...I'm honestly quite impressed\r\nyou made it this far.”",
  "BK_5000_0010_NAR": "Before them stood Púca, \r\nthe ostentatious faerie from earlier.\r\nHe appeared slightly charred\r\nfrom the explosion.",
  "LV_005010_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Just leap in claws first.\r\nDon't give yourself a chance to be afraid.[FONT:N ]",
  "BK_5000_0180_NAR": "Once again, Cheshire had\r\nrejected Púca's offer.",
  "SM_005020_0050_FAS": "“Just doing my part. I told you,\r\nit's my job to know the goings-on in Avalon.”",
  "BK_5000_0100_CER": "“Cheshire?”",
  "IN_5000_0020_CER": "“An a-angel!?\r\nWhat is one of those doing here?”",
  "BK_5000_0060_NAR": "The faerie Púca was trying \r\nto tempt Cheshire, offering\r\nto send him back to Inferno.\r\nDid he truly have the power to open\r\na portal right here, right now?",
  "LV_005905_0000_CER": "Cheshire, are you feeling better?\r\nDoes it still hurt?",
  "_01": "",
  "SM_005020_0180_FAS": "“I believe it is what you entered this forest to find.”",
  "BK_5000_0170_POO": "“You wool-stuffed scullion!\r\nYou witch-whipped kitten!”",
  "LV_005905_0030_CER": "Glad to hear it.",
  "CE_005010_0000_CER": "Lukaon, stop it already!",
  "CE_005120_0000_CER": "Good! That's number three!",
  "SM_005010_0020_CER": "“This feeling...Lukaon is up ahead,\r\nI'm sure of it.”",
  "BK_5010_0040_NAR": "Cheshire said nothing.\r\nHe closed his tired eyes.",
  "CE_005805_0010_NAR": "Cheshire rampaged.\r\nHe gave only violent growls in response.",
  "CE_005810_0000_CER": "I can't keep this up much longer...\r\nBut I won't leave Cheshire this way!",
  "BK_5010_0010_CER": "“Cheshire...\r\nWhy didn't you go into the portal?”",
  "CE_005835_0000_CER": "Cheshire...stop!",
  "LV_005015_0000_NAR": "A cold, bitter wind continued to blow mercilessly.\r\nBut their hearts - were not cold at all.",
  "CE_005090_0000_CER": "I'm taking back what you stole from Cheshire.",
  "CE_005050_0000_CER": "If I can just stop that machine...",
  "BK_5000_0110_NAR": "Cheshire slowly approached the gate.",
  "BK_5000_0030_POO": "“We have no words for you, girl.\r\nYour Infernal compatriot, however,\r\nstill owes us an answer to our...\r\nProposition.”",
  "CE_005830_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Run...away...[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire regained control long enough to muster a few words.",
  "CE_005825_0010_CER": "Too close!",
  "LV_005010_0000_CER": "I'm not scared.\r\nCheshire, are you ready?",
  "SM_005020_0150_FAS": "“That's why I've been waiting...\r\nWaiting for someone to wake us\r\nfrom this bad dream.”",
  "BK_5000_0000_POO": "“Halt!”",
  "BK_5000_0120_NAR": "As he neared the threshold,\r\nmemories of their journey\r\ncame flooding back to Cereza.",
  "BK_5000_0190_POO": "“So be it!\r\nBut Inferno's fires must be fed.\r\nIf you will not return, \r\nthen send that vile girl in your stead!”",
  "SM_005020_0110_FAS": "“You see...”",
  "LV_005905_0020_NAR": "But Cereza could have sworn she heard \r\nthe trace of a faint purr in his voice.",
  "CE_005060_0000_CER": "One more left...just hold on, Cheshire!",
  "BK_5000_0070_POO": "“Well, demon? \r\nYou scorned our generous offer \r\nonce before. But how will your \r\ntune change when the fires of \r\nInferno tickle your mane?”",
  "SM_005020_0080_FAS": "“Maybe you're right.\r\nNext time I'll ask you for directions!”",
  "LV_005020_0000_CER": "Cheshire, let's fight our way through!",
  "CE_005150_0000_CER": "I'm not letting anyone have Cheshire!\r\nDon't even think about it!",
  "CE_005815_0010_CER": "Hold on, Cheshire!",
  "LV_005905_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]I'm fine.[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire said nothing more.",
  "SM_005020_0120_FAS": "“I've lived in Avalon forest for ages now.\r\nIt used to be such a beautiful, lovely place.”",
  "LV_005910_0000_CER": "Uwaaaah!",
  "BK_5000_0040_POO": "“Too long has a demon suffered \r\nunder the oppressive yoke \r\nof that wee witch.\r\n\r\nLeave her! And by our own hand\r\na portal to Inferno we shall rend!”",
  "CE_005805_0000_CER": "Cheshire! Are you in there?\r\nDon't you recognise me?",
  "SM_005020_0160_CER": "“Ignis, were you-”",
  "CE_005190_0000_CER": "Here we gooo, Cheshire---!!!!",
  "SM_005010_0030_NAR": "Somehow Cereza knew that if she\r\nstepped beyond this point there \r\nwould be no turning back.",
  "SM_005010_0000_NAR": "They had returned to the forest.\r\nA new path appeared before their eyes.\r\n",
  "LV_005005_0020_CER": "The heart of the forest...\r\nWhere Lukaon is waiting.",
  "CE_005030_0000_CER": "If I get hit by that blast I'm finished...",
  "IN_5000_0000_CER": "“Again?! Wait, something's different...”",
  "CE_005100_0000_CER": "All right, one element down!",
  "IN_5000_0030_CER": "“You got it Cheshire,\r\nlet's show him what we can do!”",
  "LV_005005_0010_CER": "I see...that must be the entrance...",
  "IN_5010_0010_CER": "“Are you ready Cheshire?\r\nI'm not sure...”",
  "SM_005020_0190_CER": "“Do you mean...Lukaon?”",
  "SM_005020_0200_FAS": "“Go on.\r\nThe seal to the altar is now broken.”",
  "SM_005010_0040_CER": "“We're getting close Cheshire.\r\nWhen you're ready,\r\nlet's go finish this.”\r\n",
  "BK_5000_0240_NAR": "             Until...",
  "BK_5010_0020_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]That weirdo? Couldn't trust him. [FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire replied, \r\nbefore turning away. ",
  "CE_005820_0010_CER": "Don't worry. I'm here for you.",
  "LV_005900_0010_NAR": "Cheshire gave an annoyed snort. \r\n[FONT:10 ]He'll show that smug face of his \r\nbefore long, I'm sure. [FONT:N ]",
  "BK_5010_0060_NAR": "Cereza sung him a lullaby\r\nshe remembered from long ago.",
  "SM_005020_0040_CER": "“We couldn't have done it without you, Ignis!\r\nYour advice really helped us out.”",
  "SM_005020_0070_CER": "“We've seen so much of this forest,\r\nI dare say we know more about it than you.”",
  "BK_5000_0230_NAR": "Cereza's question fell on deaf ears.\r\nPúca was busy cackling maniacally.",
  "CE_005000_0000_CER": "Cheshire!\r\nLukaon, stop! Give him back!",
  "CE_005130_0000_CER": "And...four!\r\nWe've taken back everything you stole, Lukaon!",
  "SM_005020_0030_FAS": "“Congratulations on destroying all four cores.\r\nYou've put those faeries in a right kerfuffle!”",
  "SM_005020_0000_FAS": "“You've finally done it, miss.”",
  "CE_005800_0000_CER": "Cheshire...",
  "CE_005825_0000_CER": "Ahh!",
  "BK_5000_0090_NAR": "With a flamboyant flourish, the \r\nfaerie opened a massive fiery gate.\r\nCereza could feel the heat \r\nfrom beyond. The familiar sounds \r\nof the forest were joined by \r\nthe faint cries of the damned.",
  "LV_005005_0000_NAR": "With all the Elemental Cores destroyed,\r\nthe barrier put up by the faeries disappeared.",
  "SM_005020_0140_FAS": "“They corrupted this forest \r\nand terrorised its inhabitants.\r\nI've seen them do such horrible things,\r\npowerless to do anything but watch.”",
  "CE_005080_0000_CER": "Oh no, run!!",
  "SM_005020_0155_FAS": "“I'd have done it myself, if I still...”",
  "BK_5000_0020_CER": "“Well if it isn't the self-proclaimed king.\r\nWhat is it this time?”",
  "SM_005020_0170_FAS": "“...Sorry, I got carried away for a second.\r\nAhead, lies that which the faeries have\r\nfought so hard to keep from you.”",
  "CE_005040_0000_CER": "Nothing my magic can't fix!",
  "LV_005015_0010_NAR": "Together, they could overcome any obstacle.\r\nThat belief caused their hearts to shine brighter than the sun.",
  "CE_005170_0000_CER": "Ngh!",
  "BK_5010_0030_CER": "“So does that mean...\r\nYou trust me?”",
  "BK_5000_0250_CER": "“Cheshire?...What's wrong?”",
  "SM_005020_0100_CER": "“Waiting...why?”",
  "SM_005020_0010_NAR": "A voice echoed through the trees.\r\nIt was one of the rare sounds in this \r\nforest that put Cereza's heart at ease.",
  "IN_5010_0000_NAR": "Beyond this point \r\nthere is no turning back.",
  "CE_005070_0000_CER": "Cheshireeeee!",
  "BK_5000_0220_CER": "“What have you done to him?!”",
  "CE_005805_0020_CER": "What should I do...\r\nMaybe I can help him with my magic?",
  "SM_005010_0010_NAR": "It seemed to call to Cereza,\r\nas if a strange force were pulling her.",
  "LV_005900_0000_CER": "You think the white wolf is okay?",
  "CE_005180_0000_CER": "Nnnngh!!",
  "CE_005815_0000_CER": "Now!",
  "SM_005020_0090_FAS": "“...I've been waiting a long time \r\nfor someone like you, miss.”",
  "SM_005020_0130_FAS": "“...The faeries changed that.”"
}
